{"id":"vod_lz_41923","vodId":"41923","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠Z","name_cn":"龙珠Z","date":"1989-01-01","year":"1989","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20221207-1/f3d74ffa45d82e1542e7226826c43a8e.jpg"},"summary":"　　结束了与新短笛大魔王的天下第一比武大会，我们的地球迎来了长达五年的和平时期，数次拯救世界的孙悟空（野泽雅子 饰）在此期间与琪琪走入婚姻殿堂，并生下了可爱的儿子悟饭。然而更大的危机一波又一波向勇敢的战士们袭来。打头阵的赛亚人拉迪兹，意外揭开了悟空的身世。宿命的对手贝吉塔则 让悟空真正见识到高手的存在。在此之后，那美克星、弗利札、超级赛亚人、人造人、未来少年、魔人布欧。精彩戏码接连上演，拉开了龙珠Z的宏大篇章……　　本片根据日本漫画家鸟山明的同名经典原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,动画,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-12-02 21:19:31","classic":true,"classicRank":41,"franchise":"龙珠","playable":true,"episodeCount":291,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32760_250d79bb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32761_32e84d34/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32762_69e43083/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32763_33f0fb95/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32764_9ac49cda/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32765_2911ded7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32766_0a8f3096/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32767_bd20638f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32768_ea294e7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32769_e66d7ce6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32770_55c416c7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32771_a4db5838/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32772_98f4d345/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn8.com/20221201/32774_4a4f2548/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://